{"lines":[{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Introduction","w":0.11522633870442711,"y":0.033430232425720519,"c":1,"x":0.80658436138572143},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"HOW SHOULD YOU INTERPRET YOUR SCORES?","c":1,"x":0.084362143582417032,"y":0.079799764543933893,"w":0.64197530110677092},{"w":0.80041152954101558,"t":"At the end of each Listening and Reading answer key you will find a chart which will help","h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.1177325579937708,"c":1,"x":0.082304523191380666},{"x":0.082304532318802526,"w":0.79629628499348959,"t":"you assess whether, on the basis of your Practice Test results, you are ready to take the","c":1,"y":0.13515901081993031,"h":0.017457268403753168},{"y":0.1523527353219486,"t":"IELTS test.","x":0.082032179262281943,"w":0.1056634775797526,"h":0.015099937699568411,"c":1},{"t":"In interpreting your score, there are a number of points you should bear in mind. Your","y":0.16997193923019638,"w":0.77376291910807304,"x":0.10283418035557844,"h":0.018000201145527139,"c":1},{"y":0.18895348823947011,"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"performance in the real IELTS test will be reported in two ways: there will be a Band Score","w":0.81481480916341142,"x":0.084362142638242779},{"w":0.79218109130859382,"x":0.08230451597475498,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1,"y":0.20639534867797216,"t":"from 1 to 9 for each of the components and an Overall Band Score from 1 to 9, which is"},{"w":0.81285374959309897,"y":0.22367755423860314,"c":1,"x":0.082263964453998334,"h":0.018711026060286295,"t":"the average of your scores in the four components. However, institutions considering your"},{"x":0.084362148296492301,"w":0.77777776082356787,"c":1,"t":"application are advised to look at both the Overall Band Score and the Band Score for","y":0.24263839811341115,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"y":0.26017441846840228,"c":1,"h":0.014560564106288476,"x":0.086419766009304719,"w":0.80452672322591146,"t":"each component in order to determine whether you have the language skills needed for a"},{"w":0.81687240600585931,"h":0.017441860778592888,"x":0.084362150825945531,"c":1,"t":"particular course of study. For example, if your course involves a lot of reading and writing,","y":0.27761627891012219},{"t":"but no lectures, listening skills might be less important and a score of 5 in Listening might be","y":0.29407987191214646,"c":1,"h":0.018741524542459143,"x":0.084306964208628876,"w":0.8313897705078126},{"t":"acceptable if the Overall Band Score was 7. However, for a course which has lots of lectures","x":0.084362148060594777,"y":0.31242638381965038,"w":0.83539093017578137,"h":0.0175154767974387,"c":1},{"h":0.016195524146054296,"c":1,"t":"and spoken instructions, a score of 5 in Listening might be unacceptable even though the","x":0.084362127257523511,"w":0.80452677408854179,"y":0.33127208488187376},{"y":0.34883720915163641,"w":0.24691357930501301,"h":0.016003780005536927,"x":0.084362140282155218,"c":1,"t":"Overall Band Score was 7."},{"y":0.36627906962161616,"c":1,"x":0.10699587399341984,"h":0.015988372380376759,"w":0.79218109130859382,"t":"Once you have marked your tests, you should have some idea of whether your listening"},{"t":"and reading skills are good enough for you to try the IELTS test. If you did well enough in","w":0.80246912638346357,"x":0.084362144592753721,"c":1,"h":0.016022611984234936,"y":0.38368669048150161},{"x":0.084291093256021937,"w":0.8314338684082031,"y":0.40045576114399939,"t":"one component, but not in others, you will have to decide for yourself whether you are ready","h":0.019929616274345086,"c":1},{"t":"to take the test.","x":0.082304525899753636,"h":0.016043156420524562,"y":0.42005813937455239,"w":0.14403292338053386,"c":1},{"t":"The Practice Tests have been checked to ensure that they are the same level of difficulty","c":1,"y":0.43749999985414489,"x":0.10493827620623411,"w":0.80246912638346357,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"t":"as the real IELTS test. However, we cannot guarantee that your score in the Practice Tests","y":0.45494186030499772,"x":0.084362150829574226,"w":0.81687240600585942,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1},{"t":"will be reflected in the real IELTS test. The Practice Tests can only give you an idea of your","x":0.084362141771324742,"h":0.016195524146054074,"c":1,"y":0.47232037670118876,"w":0.82098765055338541},{"x":0.084362150800565139,"y":0.49116607774917675,"t":"possible future performance and it is ultimately up to you to make decisions based on your","w":0.81687240600585942,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"t":"score.","y":0.51155537366728865,"w":0.059734198252360038,"h":0.013226461916003518,"c":1,"x":0.084330431618549112},{"y":0.52616279055176463,"t":"Different institutions accept different IELTS scores for different types of courses. We have","c":1,"w":0.80452677408854156,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.10699587210377387},{"y":0.54358068333097187,"c":1,"h":0.016012340046912987,"x":0.084362132388524552,"w":0.83127573649088549,"t":"based our recommendations on the average scores which the majority of institutions accept."},{"c":1,"t":"The institution to which you are applying may, of course, require a higher or lower score than","x":0.084362147975073368,"w":0.83539093017578125,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.56242638383544341},{"c":1,"y":0.57749204743448235,"t":"most other institutions.","h":0.01858953031128785,"x":0.084105039624734423,"w":0.20852951049804686},{"x":0.9074074074418873,"c":1,"y":0.90406976721529508,"w":0.016460905075073251,"t":"9","h":0.013081395583944722}],"w":2400,"h":3396}